From d8f8599e450b6818fd787674700320f772386ee5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SENDER NAME <sender@example.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:49:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Admin: Ignore superseded user and service account list
 responses

The server-admin users, service accounts and org users lists awaited their
search request without a requestId and dispatched whichever response arrived
last, so a slower response for an earlier page, sort, filter or search could
replace the newer list. Pass a fixed requestId per list so backend_srv cancels
the superseded request, and ignore the cancellation in the thunks.

Also dispatch usersFetchEnd() in the admin users catch block, which called the
action creator without dispatching it.
